# Spec for tools/riscpkg.py: Gnumeric.
Package: Gnumeric
Section: Spreadsheet
Priority: Optional
Licence: Free
Maintainer: Andrew Youll <adyoull@users.noreply.github.com>
Standards-Version: 0.4.0
Environment: arm32, vfpv3
Depends: SharedUnixLibrary (>= 1.16), ARMEABISupport, Iconv
Recommends: TTF-Noto-Color-Emoji
Components: Apps.Office.!Gnumeric (Movable LookAt)
Homepage: https://github.com/adyoull/riscos-gtk
Description: Gnumeric spreadsheet (GTK 3)
 The GNOME spreadsheet: hundreds of functions, charts, and Excel
 (.xls/.xlsx), OpenDocument, Lotus 1-2-3, Quattro Pro, HTML, CSV and
 text files. RISC OS Save and Open boxes, Wimp menus and an icon bar
 icon; CSV files open from the Filer.
 .
 This is a public beta of the riscos-gtk ports.
Build-Map: !Gnumeric -> Apps/Office/!Gnumeric
Build-Notice: Gnumeric, packaged for PackMan from the riscos-gtk release zip on
 https://github.com/adyoull/riscos-gtk/releases
 .
 Gnumeric is Gnumeric 1.12.57 (www.gnumeric.org), under the GNU GPL version 2 or 3. It is linked with GTK 3 and its
 libraries (LGPL) and includes DejaVu fonts and PThreadTicker. The
 source is offered by the Source file in the application and on the
 release page. Licences follow.
